flowchart TD
  A[Customer submits registration] --> B[Validate request]
  B --> C{Valid?}
  C -- No --> D[Return validation error]
  C -- Yes --> E[Hash password and create account]
  E --> F{Verification required?}
  F -- Yes --> G[Send verification challenge]
  F -- No --> H[Account eligible for login]
  G --> H
  H --> I[Login and issue credentials]
  I --> J[Browse active merchants and published products]
  J --> K[Submit order request]
  K --> L[Validate merchant, products, stock and address]
  L --> M{Eligible and available?}
  M -- No --> N[Return business-rule conflict]
  M -- Yes --> O[Calculate totals and reserve stock]
  O --> P[Create pending-payment order]
  P --> Q[Initiate provider payment]
  Q --> R[Verify signed provider event and deduplicate]
  R --> S{Payment successful?}
  S -- No --> T[Mark failed and release reservation]
  S -- Yes --> U[Record payment and confirm order]
  U --> V[Prepare order and assign rider]
  V --> W[Rider accepts and picks up]
  W --> X[Update delivery status and tracking]
  X --> Y[Notify customer and merchant]
  Y --> Z[Complete delivery and order]
